## Never

- **Channels:** Orbit With Ben, OpptiAI or `@HistoryOfScience` (empty, not ours).
- **Uploads:** swap a file on a live id (no Studio Replace); re-upload a public idea; delete a video (make it private).
- **Publishing:** Premiere; any video left marked Made for Kids (re-check Audience after every save); more than one Short a day; a Short of 40 s or more; a silent file; the Explorer at frame 0 of a Short; subscribe or like graphics burned into the film.
- **Titles:** hashtags, suffixes, hedged claims, or a copy of a live title.
- **Links:** `/go/` or a pinned comment on a Short; `/go/` on a long that doesn't name the product.
- **Picture:** the Orbit robot; Omni, Seedance, Kling or ElevenLabs Image & Video; Veo Fast on fragile light; paint-patching; "same DNA" in a prompt; Ken Burns when Flow is capped.
- **Voice:** anything but Ben Orbit Narrator; a video model's speech; changing a word of the signed-off script; `atempo` above 1.06. Run `tools/vo_check.py` on every take.
- **TikTok:** any direct upload while `TikTok/TIKTOK_UPLOAD_BLOCK.json` is paused; HOS TikTok goes through Buffer only (Ben, 5 Oct 2026).
